      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f84e831734a9336",
      "translationZh": "“AREX-2 是北京智源人工智能研究院（BAAI）推出的一款拥有 27B 参数的长程智能体模型。它学习如何通过测试时的多轮迭代改进解决方案：提出方案、测量、反思和修订。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0220eaf4e8233d3",
      "translationZh": "AREX-2 使用具有可验证反馈的机器学习和算法编程任务，以及现有的 AREX 深度研究数据进行训练。学到的自我改进行为能够迁移到深度研究，无需添加新的搜索轨迹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5aa4e41ff057d3ad",
      "translationZh": "架构：与 Qwen3.8 兼容的稠密多模态模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bc4b92cb52de2180",
      "translationZh": "上下文长度：262,144 个 token",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "414f37657f95a22d",
      "translationZh": "长程自我改进：将额外的测试时轮次转化为有效的解决方案优化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a69fd5bb99a8bdfe",
      "translationZh": "反馈驱动的反思：读取评分、日志、错误和耗时信息，以决定下一步要做哪些更改。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ca9f07a9b0d3134",
      "translationZh": "跨领域表现：在编程和机器学习任务上进行训练，也能提升模型的深度研究表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd2c5fb010a35fd0",
      "translationZh": "长程推理：随着任务预算增加，持续进行富有成效的迭代。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
